WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:03,930
what did you do

2
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:06,330
Why is your father being so wronged now?

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:07,530
call him out

4
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:08,530
Let me tell him something

5
00:00:08,530 --> 00:00:09,960
I'm dead too

6
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,760
Saved a drowning child

7
00:00:11,760 --> 00:00:12,960
I don’t know my physical strength

8
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:13,960
Didn't climb up

9
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:20,410
Your father came to my place a while ago

10
00:00:20,410 --> 00:00:24,900
It's all fate

11
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:25,900
Come inside

12
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:29,720
Your grandfather came to see me before he passed away

13
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:31,780
You want me to change your life

14
00:00:31,780 --> 00:00:32,780
I refused

15
00:00:32,780 --> 00:00:35,460
Go out first and hit the mark by cause and effect and talk about fate

16
00:00:35,460 --> 00:00:37,460
Changing one's life has too many consequences

17
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:38,460
I can't bear it

18
00:00:38,460 --> 00:00:39,460
When I changed his longevity doctor

19
00:00:39,460 --> 00:00:41,460
He has a note there

20
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,460
Water got wet

21
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,680
Only recognized one modified character

22
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:48,820
It's not what you wrote.

23
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:49,820
Tell me about it

24
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,820
What have you been doing these days?

25
00:00:51,820 --> 00:00:52,890
Normally

26
00:00:52,890 --> 00:00:54,890
No enemy can come close to you

27
00:00:54,890 --> 00:00:59,800
Zhou Tian, you are pure tiger

28
00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:00,800
You choose the word Jiyin

29
00:01:00,800 --> 00:01:01,800
Born to be haunted by ghosts

30
00:01:01,800 --> 00:01:02,800
More than ten years

31
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:03,800
It has always been Guitang who protects you

32
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:04,800
Good for you

33
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:06,800
I picked up Tang Dan in two out of three times.

34
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:07,800
Now they are angry

35
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:09,800
You might be scared to death in a few days

36
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:10,800
And that big black thing

37
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:12,800
You asked for your life for free when you were born

38
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:13,800
He summons the whole clan to protect you and save you

39
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:15,800
You are just like Bai Erlang now

40
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,800
Bite them back

41
00:01:18,180 --> 00:01:20,180
I thought that black cloth was something that could harm me

42
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:22,180
Do you have rice or millet at home?

43
00:01:22,180 --> 00:01:23,180
Sorghum rice, mung beans and black beans

44
00:01:23,180 --> 00:01:26,600
Only dried noodles left

45
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:27,600
Uncle will take you to dinner

46
00:01:27,600 --> 00:01:28,600
Buy some rice by the way
